Subject: [PATCH 04/23] window: Update the active workspace from
 main_monitor_changed()

update_active_workspace() was called from two places, once after
placement in meta_window_constructed() and once in
meta_window_move_resize_internal() next to the target monitor update.
Setting the target monitor is not the same thing as the main monitor
changing, and meta_window_constructed() calls
meta_window_main_monitor_changed() anyway.

Call it from meta_window_main_monitor_changed() instead, which is where
the window's monitor is known to have changed, and covers both paths.
---
