- * Signal handler called when monitor configuration changes.
- * Sets up per-monitor workspaces if they haven't been initialized yet.
+ * Rebuilds the per-monitor containers for the monitors there are now, keeping
+ * the workspaces of the monitors that are still around and creating them for
