Several of these sites already branched on whether per-monitor workspaces
are enabled and then called the same function in both branches, relying on
it to change meaning. Spell out which index is wanted instead, which also
fixes the places where the two spaces were being mixed:

 - the accessibility notification looked up the workspace name with a
   monitor-relative position, and the names are a single global list, so on
   any monitor but the first it announced the wrong name
